  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the participation of women in transitional justice mechanisms to contribute to sustainable peace in Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Title: Supporting the participation of women in transitional justice mechanisms to contribute to sustainable peace in Somalia.

Project Impact: Gender sensitive and survivor-centred accountability and truth-seeking transitional justice mechanisms contribute to successful peace processes in building lasting peace.

Outcome 1: Victims, survivors, and women&#x2019;s groups are empowered to engage in transitional justice processes and their implementation.
Outcome 2: Transitional justice mechanisms are responsive to the specific needs and priorities of victims and survivors of conflict related sexual violence and other crimes impacting women.</narrative>
  </description>
